🔋 12V Hot-Swap & Power Protection PCB

A custom 12 V hot-swap and power protection PCB designed in Altium Designer using the LTC4231IMS Hot-Swap Controller.

The board is designed to provide controlled power switching and input protection for downstream electronics using external power MOSFETs and programmable voltage protection thresholds.

🎯 Objective:- 

    The objective of this project was to design a compact power-management PCB capable of:-

           1. Controlled connection of a 12 V power source to a load
           2. Protecting downstream electronics from abnormal input conditions
           3. Implementing programmable undervoltage and overvoltage monitoring
           4. Handling the main power path through external NMOS devices
           5. Providing transient voltage protection at the input
           6. Integrating the protection circuitry into a practical PCB layout

⚡ Circuit Overview

The design is centered around the __LTC4231IMS__, which controls the external NMOS power stage and monitors the input power conditions.

```text
12V Input
    │
    ├──► TVS Protection
    │
    ▼
LTC4231 Hot-Swap Controller
    │
    ├──► Voltage Monitoring
    │
    ├──► Gate Control
    │
    ▼
External NMOS Power Stage
    │
    ▼
Protected Output
```

A resistor network connected to the controller is used to configure the voltage-monitoring thresholds, while the external MOSFET stage controls the high-current power path.

## 🛡️ Protection & Power Features

* **Hot-swap power control**
* **Undervoltage monitoring**
* **Overvoltage monitoring**
* **External NMOS power switching**
* **Input transient suppression**
* **Controlled MOSFET gate drive**
* **Dedicated input and output connectors**
* **12 V input power architecture**

An **SMBJ15A TVS diode** is included across the input supply for transient voltage suppression.

## 🔩 Major Components

| Component                 | Function                                          |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| **LTC4231IMS**            | Hot-swap and power-path controller                |
| **External NMOS MOSFETs** | Main power switching stage                        |
| **SMBJ15A**               | Input transient voltage suppression               |
| **LM7805**                | 5 V linear voltage regulation                     |
| **Resistor Network**      | Programs voltage monitoring thresholds            |
| **CT Capacitor**          | Controller timing configuration                   |
| **ATmega328P**            | Microcontroller section included in the schematic |
| **J1 / J2**               | Power input/output connections                    |

