## 🖥️ PCB Design

The PCB was designed and routed in **Altium Designer** with attention to:

* Compact component placement
* Separation of control and power circuitry
* Short power-path connections
* Placement of the MOSFETs near the power path
* Accessible input/output connectors
* Practical component orientation
* Power and ground routing

